id=hypercameramod
name=HyperCameraMod (LUT stage)
version=1.3.0-306
versionCode=306
author=rezikham
description=HyperCameraMod 1.3.0-306 LUT stage. Stages the authentic 17U M3 Monopan, M9 Leica Natural and derived M10R LUTs plus all 12 Camera 5.3 film-filter LUTs (600F, BF70, R600, P100F, F-50, KC64, V250, H400, KP160, FC400, C-50D, KG200) at /data/vendor/camera and enables camera.debug.mivi3.output.jpeg. No libraries, no plugin mounts, no /odm or /vendor modifications, and no APK install.
